	optdepends = bcachefs-tools: inspect the bcachefs backend subvolumes
	optdepends = btrfs-progs: support btrfs backend devices
	optdepends = fuse-overlayfs: for deprecated storage driver in rootless environment
	optdepends = podlet: Generate Podman Quadlet files from a Podman command, compose file, or existing object
	optdepends = podman-compose: for docker-compose compatibility
	optdepends = podman-desktop: GUI and tray to manage Podman containers (and Kubernetes pods)
